00:12:24.877 --> 00:12:27.445
to men, women and children
living with HIV AIDS,

00:12:27.445 --> 00:12:29.081
cancer and other
serious illnesses,

00:12:29.081 --> 00:12:30.715
and they need your help
now more than ever.

00:12:30.715 --> 00:12:33.418
If you're watching this online,
you can hit the donate button.

00:12:33.418 --> 00:12:36.021
Stay safe, wash your hands,
wear a mask.

00:12:36.021 --> 00:12:36.922
We love you.

